{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看見日光之下有一件可悲的事，重重地壓在人身上："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["上帝賜給人財富、產業和尊榮，叫他擁有所渴望的一切，卻使他無法享用，倒讓別人享用。這是虛空，是極大的悲哀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若有一百個兒子，並且長壽，但心中卻從未因福樂而滿足，死後又不得安葬，我看這樣的人還不如流產的胎兒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這胎兒在虛空中來，在黑暗中去，名字隱沒在黑暗中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["沒有見過天日，一無所知，然而這胎兒比那人更享安息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["就算那人活了千年，又活千年，卻不能享受福樂，又如何呢？世人最終豈不都同歸一處嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["人人為口腹勞碌，卻永不滿足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那麼，智者比愚人有什麼優勢呢？貧窮人即使懂得如何處世，又有什麼益處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["滿足於眼前所有的，勝過心中貪想的。這也是虛空，如同捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["一切存在的事物都已命名，人的本質也被識透；人無法與比他更強的較量。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["其實話越多，越虛空，這對人又有什麼益處？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人生短暫虛空，如影飛逝，有誰知道什麼對人有益？誰能告訴人死後日光之下會發生什麼事？"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}